howed his usual\n extraordinary strength. His name has become proverbial for one who possesses\n immense strength and courage]."}]}],"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"+ .{@-मः@}"}]}]}],"Bimam":[{"id":"BImam","headword":"भीमम्","headword_slp1":"BImam","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"+ .{@-मम्@} Horror, terror.\n.━{@Comp.@}: भीमाञ्जस्, भीमोदरी, भीमैकादशी, भीमकर्मन्, भीमतिथिः, भीमदर्शन, भीममुख, भीमनाद, भीमपराक्रम, भीमपुरम्, भीमरथः, भीमरथी, भीमरूप, भीमविक्रम, भीमविक्रान्त, भीमविग्रह, भीमवेग, भीमशङ्करम्, भीमशासनः, भीमसेनः, भीमहासम्"}]}]}],"BimaYjas":[{"id":"BImAYjas","headword":"भीमाञ्जस्","headword_slp1":"BImAYjas","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"+ -अञ्जस् a. having terrible strength."}]}]}],"Bimodari":[{"id":"BImodarI","headword":"भीमोदरी","headword_slp1":"BImodarI","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"+ -उदरी an epithet of Umā."}]}]}],"BimEkadasi":[{"id":"BImEkAdaSI","headword":"भीमैकादशी","headword_slp1":"BImEkAdaSI","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"+ -एकादशी the eleventh day in the light half of Māgha."}]}]}],"Bimakarman":[{"id":"BImakarman","headword":"भीमकर्मन्","headword_slp1":"BImakarman","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"+ -कर्मन् a. of terrific prowess; पौण्ड्रं दध्मौ महाशङ्खं\n भीमकर्मा वृकोदरः "},{"t":"cite","s":"Bg. 1. 15","q":"Bg"},{"t":"txt","s":"."}]}]}],"BimatiTiH":[{"id":"BImatiTiH","headword":"भीमतिथिः","headword_slp1":"BImatiTiH","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"+ -तिथिः f. = भीमैकादशी."}]}]}],"Bimadarsana":[{"id":"BImadarSana","headword":"भीमदर्शन","headword_slp1":"BImadarSana","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"+ -दर्शन, -मुख a. frightful in appearance, hideous."}]}]}],"BimamuKa":[{"id":"BImamuKa","headword":"भीममुख","headword_slp1":"BImamuKa","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"+ -दर्शन, -मुख a. frightful in appearance, hideous."}]}]}],"Bimanada":[{"id":"BImanAda","headword":"भीमनाद","headword_slp1":"BImanAda","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"+ -नाद a. sounding dread